{"id":"n84254-2-9","stage":4,"title":"핥다 · (喻义)水、火、光、视线等轻轻经过、照到或停留在物体表面。","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84254-2-9-1","ko":"바람이 부니 참 시원하다.","zh":"风一吹真凉快。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바람이","meaning":"风","explanation":"바람：风；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부니","meaning":"刮，吹","explanation":"불다：刮，吹；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"불다","audio":"/audio/1389fa35feb8849f522f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74179","senseId":"1","lemma":"불다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시원하다.","meaning":"凉爽，凉快","explanation":"시원하다：凉爽，凉快；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"1","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"风","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"85627","definition":"气压的变化或者人类、机器等引起的空气的流动。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"1389fa35feb8849f","term":"불다","zh":"刮，吹","audio":"/audio/1389fa35feb8849f522f.mp3","entryId":"74179","definition":"风起而向某个方向移动。","pronunciation":["불ː다"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"凉爽，凉快","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"不冷不热，适当清凉。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8ea7d613cd4199b65358.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84254-2-9-2","ko":"그러게. 마치 우리 몸을 핥고 지나가는 것 같아.","zh":"是啊，好像轻轻舔