","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"64c09c33fcaaef3d","term":"마치","zh":"犹如，仿佛，好像","audio":"/audio/64c09c33fcaaef3d22ce.mp3","entryId":"56092","definition":"与别的相比较而言。","pronunciation":["마치"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"7f13624e3798b391","term":"핥다","zh":"(喻义)水、火、光、视线等轻轻经过、照到或停留在物体表面。","audio":"/audio/7f13624e3798b3916059.mp3","entryId":"84254","definition":"(喻义)水、火、光、视线等轻轻经过、照到或停留在物体表面。","pronunciation":["할따"]},{"id":"9c25392f9bf0bb82","term":"지나가다","zh":"经过，略过","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3","entryId":"60216","definition":"风刮过或雨下过。","pronunciation":["지나가다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/cd0b1973303ff7aef376.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.053,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84254","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":146,"sequenceScore":2.8797,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，好像轻轻舔过我们身上一样。","就是用枪把玩偶打中的意思对吧？","风一吹真凉快。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是啊，好像轻轻舔过我们身上一样。","风一吹真凉快。","就是用枪把玩偶打中的意思对吧？"],"answer":0}]}
